    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "Sat4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I came here because I liked the small-town atmosphere, and the potential for a holistic approach to patient care.#$e#I've grown to really love it.$h",
      "translation": "Přišel jsem sem kvůli příjemné atmosféře malého města a možnosti celostního přístupu k péči o pacienty.#$e#Opravdu jsem si to tu zamiloval.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "74ef5588d2300abec36f50f36ec753c6fd0e42bff4ede4c471d046de094e96fd",
      "translationSHA256": "417ec779140ef1f5fdef8203a5004164ad15ef439dbdda900383bf1ecee415d2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "Sat10",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*Sigh*... I'm starting to feel kind of old...#$e#The older you get the more memories you're burdened with. It can be overwhelming.$s#$e#I think I'll stay younger with you around.$l",
      "translation": "*Povzdech*... Začínám si připadat trochu starý...#$e#Čím je člověk starší, tím více vzpomínek ho tíží. Někdy toho může být příliš.$s#$e#Myslím, že s tebou po boku zůstanu mladší.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "f9329616a603e1fb4e5180fca9058d9c5c05e39b482b44005d831595a93cf3a8",
      "translationSHA256": "af44237c80135d08a1e30d09fe522244bb5c0ac8c0ba610a54d58b8b908184e2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm... I'm struggling to make ends meet. I don't have enough patients.#$e#I guess I should try to get patients from the neighboring towns...",
      "translation": "Hmm... Jen stěží vyjdu s penězi. Nemám dost pacientů.#$e#Asi bych se měl pokusit získat pacienty ze sousedních měst...",
      "sourceSHA256": "80289e0fafe36d62b3df5734dfbbea32f61d2f6e6fb5391e364f5eeb01fd8511",
      "translationSHA256": "ee275996d677080419c086bb9ffb1c6a7a97cc0f91683a0bfd62d151d7fc2d6c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Imagine having a patient's life completely in your hands, and failing to keep them alive... that's something that will haunt you forever.$s",
      "translation": "Představ si, že máš život pacienta zcela ve svých rukou a nepodaří se ti ho zachránit... To by tě pronásledovalo navždy.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "30f9312ea9c51b639159f44a390622a357de8ce74625d8b0e28c767a1c39d6ad",
      "translationSHA256": "5530664fe6418023469419744fcfaf88986f77a73b7f68d50ba9167a0aeba057",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "event_george1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Thanks, @.$h#$b#You see, George, I'm just trying to help you.",
      "translation": "Díky, @.$h#$b#Víš, Georgi, jen se ti snažím pomoci.",
      "sourceSHA256": "24f58faddadda31c6765bf05101e5ea731a925aa83fd76e0251b441d9025d495",
      "translationSHA256": "fad88514720d4dc68ced5df65ac42c8f5004b92bc90a0b4e74a49c063f652854",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "event_george2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*Sigh*$s#$b#Look, George. If you want to behave like this I'm going to have to tell your wife. I don't think she'll be happy.",
      "translation": "*Povzdech*$s#$b#Poslyš, Georgi. Jestli se budeš chovat takhle, budu to muset říct tvé ženě. Nemyslím, že z toho bude mít radost.",
      "sourceSHA256": "aebca9699ac2c1dd6acdca8e5c108d2b40d514dddb08c4364475ec30c2809f66",
      "translationSHA256": "fc17a41ab20690a3227d68f49dcdd74488809d7fd027fe4bc5f65db705c2e685",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "event_aerobics1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Thanks, @. I appreciate that.$h",
      "translation": "Díky, @. Vážím si toho.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "f1ec004dc39964de71914e04ce2a4bf6fb237bc955e9ac1e97c5df75cf92de47",
      "translationSHA256": "1cbeb0df15dcb93cefdc909797311c80e7d119b33d2ecaca79bc4bc3659a9301",
      "reviewChecks": [
