    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "summer_Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's okay to get a moderate amount of sunlight. Just don't get burnt.#$e#Okay. Take care! Stay healthy.",
      "translation": "Přiměřené množství slunečního světla je v pořádku. Jen ať se nespálíš.#$e#Dobře. Opatruj se! Ať ti slouží zdraví.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e509efe6bd97a33b373268b03f9afbb9f6b830eb571b50b00d04090bb67d6c07",
      "translationSHA256": "75f39ac79c70c45ff2d9ee26e9e1f94769e84adb75d4a74048674f738701f35c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "summer_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Exercise is important, but don't get too exhausted, or you might end up at my clinic!#$e#Make sure and listen to your body.",
      "translation": "Pohyb je důležitý, ale nevyčerpej se příliš, jinak můžeš skončit na mé klinice!#$e#Nezapomeň naslouchat svému tělu.",
      "sourceSHA256": "3596a7bf0dbda02c1826c003aaf9e3cd34968dacea803eda6a51a9bfb69ec5cb",
      "translationSHA256": "23bcaeb3a9759eb3c3bc17f13dfd5d651d96cdea8ad769cf48d0e7c46a067428",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "summer_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "People don't get sick much during the summer. That's nice, but it also means less business for me.",
      "translation": "V létě lidé moc nestonají. To je příjemné, ale zároveň to pro mě znamená méně práce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "621e879e1a66a733409717552bcbb5a5008722fd0c004c78cc06baac26a7adba",
      "translationSHA256": "54a842e9a804e321760ad75a92d332bfaa08ea7a85ed3f425a988f8d00741fd9",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "fall_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have you been going into the mines, @?#$e#It's a dangerous place. I recommend against it.",
      "translation": "Chodíš do dolů, @?#$e#Je to nebezpečné místo. Nedoporučuji tam chodit.",
      "sourceSHA256": "96e81e6974aff381f9ad61dfcf7c38a1c3ee5a617bddbab28c6298ec0dd34a99",
      "translationSHA256": "b5a43f3e35895dfe7d2b18295cba84f41196c47a264b93f652660174f5c4766e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "fall_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When you eat certain foods you'll perform better.#$e#Eating a 'Farmer's Lunch' will give you the nutrition you need to water and harvest crops better!",
      "translation": "Po určitých jídlech budeš podávat lepší výkony.#$e#‚Farmářský oběd‘ ti dodá živiny potřebné k lepšímu zalévání a sklízení plodin!",
      "sourceSHA256": "920e0d5e9456d2476517b9b8e66cb405d7522edc66674606a1c96953bd9781f9",
      "translationSHA256": "933e4dd339c01210cffee706e958e1df8d3afece1ba3fe8307fcc2179c98866c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "winter_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's flu season, so you'd better be extra careful.#$e#Make sure to wash your hands often.",
      "translation": "Je chřipkové období, takže je potřeba dávat si obzvlášť pozor.#$e#Nezapomeň si často mýt ruce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e86c5f85873be6fc951a32061e883ee783a6e29c123f90204671c08ba959078f",
      "translationSHA256": "cbf5df40b42886bf1602ba1806ca8228c22bf84443d78380c014c6f48824dcfb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Harvey",
      "key": "winter_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I hate to say this, but I do make a lot more money during flu season.#$e#I guess if people stopped getting sick, I'd be out of business.#$e#Don't get the wrong idea! I want people to be healthy... really!",
      "translation": "Nerad to říkám, ale během chřipkového období opravdu vydělávám mnohem více peněz.#$e#Kdyby lidé přestali stonat, asi bych přišel o živobytí.#$e#Nevykládej si to špatně! Chci, aby byli lidé zdraví... opravdu!",
      "sourceSHA256": "86a3b87c5794a5c0ae4dee44ab3faceb0e75c8c998cdf9475fa01f02e95167a5",
      "translationSHA256": "d830c725746f13a2a07ad8163eafe007aba1b8eacc2c286ae62fba70209012f1",
      "reviewChecks": [
